[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Rescue General DJ Devil</h2>
<i>"You're expecting nothing. Suddenly they're all over you. That's hell."<br>
--DDC-Striker-DDC </i>  

<p>While you were about to be promoted to Captain together with Marquis Martin a distress call by Balloon was received. General DJ Devil who together with Admiral DDC-Striker-DDC is the leader of DDC is under attack! He was heading to the DDC-center to witness your promotion. While he was underway he was - strangely enough - attacked by the same guild of pirates you were in the previous mission. You were send there on all speed to rescue General DJ Devil.

<p>Your mission is to rescue General DJ Devil.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Perfect! Those pirates are history!</h2>
<p>
Thanks for coming to the rescue, Captain. I will make sure you will be rewarded! Now to find out who those pirates really are because they are too well organized for just some pirates!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Razorianwar3

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Lord DJ Devil is slain</h2>
<p>Lord DJ Devil is dead. When you finish the battle, your career is over.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead and the pirates have succeeded. 

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]